    "Haiku 4.5 is pinned to its dated model ID (stable prompt caching). Sonnet 4.6, Opus 4.7, and every ChatGPT / Gemini / DeepSeek / Grok model ID are still floating aliases — a provider could silently repoint them and briefly disrupt caching. Will pin once dated IDs are confirmed." : {
