    "The large circular gauge (0-100) is your composite recovery score. It uses ln(RMSSD) z-score normalization against your personal 60-day baseline, automatically selecting the best available scoring tier (HRV-only, HRV + Sleep, or HRV + Sleep + Vitals at 60/25/15)." : {
