    "Training Stress Balance — CTL minus ATL. Positive = fresh, negative = fatigued." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "توازن إجهاد التدريب — CTL ناقص ATL. الموجب = منتعش، والسالب = مُرهَق."
